---
import { getLatestPatch } from '../../lib/data';
import HomeReturn from './HomeReturn';
import HomeSignals from './HomeSignals.astro';
import '../../styles/companion-home.css';
const latest = getLatestPatch();
const patchDate = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en', { day: 'numeric', month: 'short', year: 'numeric', timeZone: 'UTC' }).format(new Date(`${latest.releaseDate}T00:00:00Z`));
---
<div class="companion-home">
  <section class="home-arrival" aria-labelledby="companion-heading">
    <div class="home-landscape" aria-hidden="true">
      <picture><source media="(max-width: 700px)" srcset="/images/voyage/rift-overlook-mobile.webp" /><img src="/images/voyage/rift-overlook.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></picture>
    </div>
    <div class="home-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="home-arrival-grid">
      <div class="home-intro">
        <p class="home-eyebrow"><span class="home-scry-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>YOUR COMPANION BETWEEN GAMES</p>
        <h1 id="companion-heading"><span>The Rift changes.</span> <em>You’re ready.</em></h1>
        <p class="home-description">An automatic League of Legends briefing. Your recent games, the changes you missed, and a useful next focus.</p>
        <HomeReturn client:load />
        <p class="home-modes"><span>Ranked focus.</span><span>ARAM chaos.</span><span>Your kind of League.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-proof">
        <div class="home-proof-coordinate" aria-hidden="true"><span>RIFTSCRY / A CLOSER LOOK</span><span>01 — 03</span></div>
        <HomeSignals />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-arrival-footer"><p>YOU PLAY. <span>WE CONNECT THE DOTS.</span></p><a href="#home-routine">Find your rhythm <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-routine" id="home-routine" aria-labelledby="routine-heading">
    <header class="home-section-heading"><div><p class="home-eyebrow">LESS CATCHING UP. MORE PLAYING.</p><h2 id="routine-heading">Every kind of<br /><em>“one more game.”</em></h2></div><p>A fresh start, a familiar champion, a build worth another look. Pick up right where your games left off.</p></header>
    <div class="home-routine-grid">
      <a class="home-routine-card" href="/next-game#changes">
        <div class="home-routine-top"><span>01 / BACK AFTER A BREAK</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <svg class="home-routine-art" viewBox="0 0 280 112" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="home-art-line" d="M12 78h55l27-42h54l22 27h97M12 93h255"/><path class="home-art-accent" d="m76 77 25-41h47l22 27h76"/><circle cx="101" cy="36" r="7"/><circle cx="170" cy="63" r="7"/><path d="m228 55 8 8-8 8"/><path class="home-art-faint" d="M101 44v49m69-22v22M12 21h255"/></svg>
        <h3>“What did I miss?”</h3>
        <p>Changes since your last recorded game on each champion. Your match history sets the starting point.</p>
        <span class="home-routine-action">Catch up on changes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-routine-card" href="/players?view=builds">
        <div class="home-routine-top"><span>02 / FIND THAT LOADOUT</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <svg class="home-routine-art" viewBox="0 0 280 112" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="home-art-faint" d="M12 21h255M12 93h255"/><rect x="28" y="34" width="43" height="43" rx="4"/><rect x="88" y="34" width="43" height="43" rx="4"/><rect x="148" y="34" width="43" height="43" rx="4"/><path class="home-art-accent" d="m49 42 10 14-10 14-10-14 10-14Zm60 0 10 14-10 14-10-14 10-14Z"/><path d="m163 55 5 5 10-12m30 7h37m-8-8 8 8-8 8"/></svg>
        <h3>“That build felt good.”</h3>
        <p>Find the items and runes you actually used, with the champion, mode, and source match together.</p>
        <span class="home-routine-action">Find a recorded build <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-routine-card" href="/next-game">
        <div class="home-routine-top"><span>03 / BEFORE YOU QUEUE</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <svg class="home-routine-art" viewBox="0 0 280 112" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="home-art-faint" d="M12 21h255M12 93h255M140 10v91"/><circle cx="140" cy="56" r="35"/><circle class="home-art-accent" cx="140" cy="56" r="22"/><path d="m140 42 10 14-10 14-10-14 10-14ZM45 56h48m94 0h48m-10-8 10 8-10 8"/></svg>
        <h3>“Okay. One more.”</h3>
        <p>Your latest session and one useful focus, assembled from available games with the evidence attached.</p>
        <span class="home-routine-action">Open the next-game briefing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="home-routine-footnote"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Ready from your records. No notes to write. No cards to create.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="companion-explore" aria-labelledby="home-explore-heading">
    <div class="home-explore-art" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/voyage/history-strata.webp" alt="" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><svg viewBox="0 0 360 360" fill="none"><circle cx="180" cy="180" r="120"/><circle cx="180" cy="180" r="138"/><path d="m180 72 78 108-78 108-78-108 78-108Zm0-48v48m0 216v48M24 180h78m156 0h78"/><circle cx="180" cy="180" r="8"/></svg><span>THERE’S MORE TO THE RIFT.</span></div>
    <div class="home-explore-copy"><p class="home-eyebrow">FOR THE CURIOUS BETWEEN QUEUES</p><h2 id="home-explore-heading">Follow a champion.<br /><em>Find a story.</em></h2><p>Every buff, nerf, and unexpected turn has a history. Wander through the archive and see how the Rift got here.</p><div class="companion-explore-actions"><a class="companion-action companion-action--quiet" href="/explore">Explore the Rift <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="companion-text-link" href="/champions">Browse champions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><a class="home-archive-stamp" href={`/patch/${latest.id}`}><span>Latest archived patch <strong>{latest.id}</strong></span><span>{patchDate}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div>
  </section>
</div>
